// Base64-embedded copy of src/assets/hospital-crest.png (the real รพ.กรงปินัง crest,
// background removed — see HospitalCrest.tsx for how it was produced from the original
// src/assets/hospital-crest-original.jpg). print.ts builds printable documents as a raw
// HTML string opened via window.open()+document.write() into a blank popup window — a
// normal Vite asset URL isn't reliably resolvable from that context (a blank popup has no
// stable base URL to resolve a relative path against), so the image is inlined directly
// as a data URI instead, the same self-contained approach the QR codes on these sheets
// already use. Regenerate this file if hospital-crest.png is ever replaced/updated.
export const HOSPITAL_CREST_DATA_URI =
  'data:image/png;base64,';
